.LSOverride

# Personal/generated data - lives outside the project folder in the
# temporary directory (FileManager.default.temporaryDirectory), not inside
# the repo, so nothing to ignore here for mail.sqlite or the eml-corpus
# cache - but flagging why they're absent from this list rather than just
# silently missing.